## .NET build output. The MemberPortal app has its own .gitignore; this one
## covers the pilot API so bin/obj never reach a commit.
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.user
*.suo

## Local secrets. Descope:ProjectId is not a secret, but the management key used
## by tools/get-test-token.sh is — keep both out of git regardless.
appsettings.Local.json
.env
